{"version":1,"key":"card:21","content":{"id":21,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8a8521dd-32ff-48c5-b81c-c793133f41b1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们使用接口来描述对象的类型，接口中规定了对象应该包含的属性及其类型，标注为该接口的对象，必须包含这个接口中规定的属性，"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"不能多也不能少"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5cc3c831-2895-4df6-aeb0-6f09f4fa868d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"interface "},{"type":"formatted","text":"声明一个接口"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"5ace8313-dc6d-456b-89ef-acfe9ca77a95","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"69a2b22e-49a7-4cbf-882b-0191fad2b852","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"interface Person {\n  name: string;\n  age: number;\n}\n\nconst p: Person = {\n  name: \"Alice\",\n  age: 18\n}","collabId":"12d36f91-b7ad-4847-98cf-fa12c503ecec","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fc89ce30-af7d-490a-b086-66bf3d31f715","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以对接口中属性进行修饰，常见的有两种，可选和只读。一旦属性声明为可选，那么标注为该接口的对象中可以包含这个属性，也可以不包含"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"4ad0b01e-2023-4c54-9b7d-fb6bb51538df","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"4f2862c1-3f04-45be-974e-ee7e6b968966","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"interface Person {\n  name: string;\n  age: number;\n  gender: string;\n}\n\nconst p1: Person = {\n  name: \"Alice\",\n  age: 18,\n  // 可以包含这个属性\n  gender: \"female\"\n}\n\nconst p2: Person = {\n  name: \"Bob\",\n  age: 18,\n  // 也可以不包含\n}","collabId":"6eeac9ec-bb56-4036-8349-182a6d179cd8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"98a0d94b-51ed-48cc-a715-13674ff94fd3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为这个属性是可选的，因此在使用时需要先判断是否存在，存在才可以使用"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"153b651e-9711-4626-8508-f76988a53438","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"a30d085b-4594-434b-b593-723ab196eb8e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// 先判断在使用\nif (p1.gender) {\n  console.log(p1.gender);\n}\n\n// 使用可选链\nconsole.log(p1?.gender);\n\n// 我们知道其一定有值，可以断言为非空\nconsole.log(p1.gender!);","collabId":"ac80c941-70b9-495d-be5a-0e32aba5f9f1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2045daac-191f-4725-926d-949f9f1d5336","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"另一种修饰符为可选修饰符，对于被 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"readonly"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 修饰的属性，将是只读的，不能被继续修改"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"b2e0fd4e-e49b-4d5a-9a4b-33a7a6077ebf","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"278a0ed5-1c1e-47b2-b0b1-c30ebf82a77d","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"interface Person {\n  readonly name: string;\n  age: number;\n}\n\nconst p: Person = {\n  name: \"Alice\",\n  age: 18\n}\n\n// name 不能被修改\n// p.name = \"Bob\"\n\n// age 可以被修改\np.age = 20;","collabId":"1001f5c7-2157-4869-b1d0-b811f60896e6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["TypeScript/数据类型/interface"],"createTime":1688914253237,"updateTime":1752923923787,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1752923923787}}